# Error handling

- Map API failures to calm, actionable copy (retry / check connection / contact support).
- Never dump raw API payloads or stack traces in the UI.
- Distinguish empty, loading, forbidden (no grant), and error states.
- DataGrant missing ≠ error: use dedicated empty state copy.
- Log details for developers in server logs only (when logging exists); keep client quiet.
